{"content_hash": "1040b50f007d5436", "version_id": 578, "article_id": 58, "level_code": "ja_n3", "lang": "ja", "level": 3, "level_label": "N3 中級", "title": "ニコン、AIで作られた画像をコンテストで失格に", "title_zh": "尼康裁定：AI生成的图像在摄影比赛中被取消资格", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "bbc_tech", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cr86z33pdy9vo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1614036417651-efe5912149d8?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8cHJpemUlMjB3aW5uaW5nJTIwaW1hZ2V8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5MTc2NTYxNXww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Brands&People on Unsplash", "author": "Brands&People", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@brandsandpeople?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/yellow-paper-award-ribbon-ZdqSuxl3Lak?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(16, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(54, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "cec84960fed8"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-12", "word_count": 194, "reading_minutes": 0.6, "lead": "ニコンは、科学写真コンテストの受賞作品が生成AIを使っていたので、規則違反として失格にしました。科学者たちが「これは本物ではない」と指摘したからです。", "lead_zh": "尼康宣布，一项科学摄影比赛的获奖作品因使用了生成式AI而被取消资格，因为科学家们指出“这不是真实的”。", "preview": "ニコンは10月9日、顕微鏡で撮った写真や動画のコンテスト「スモールワールド・イン・モーション」の受賞作品を失格にしたと発表しました。この作品は生成AIを使って作られていたので、コンテストの規則に違反しているからです。ニコンは「規則に従っていなかった」と説明しました。", "preview_zh": "尼康于10月9日宣布，取消显微镜摄影比赛“Small World In Motion”的获奖作品资格。因为该作品使用了生成式AI，违反了比赛规则。尼康解释说：“它不符合规则。”", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 566, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/58/ja_n3.mp3", "duration": 39.9, "size_bytes": 243072, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "ja-JP-NanamiNeural", "word_count": 132, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@2bf0132/content/data/versions/578.json", "paragraphs": ["ニコンは10月9日、顕微鏡で撮った写真や動画のコンテスト「スモールワールド・イン・モーション」の受賞作品を失格にしたと発表しました。この作品は生成AIを使って作られていたので、コンテストの規則に違反しているからです。ニコンは「規則に従っていなかった」と説明しました。", "受賞したのは中国の清華大学に所属するニン・シュー博士です。彼は、呼吸器の病気PCDを持つ子どもの気道で、毛のような小さな構造「繊毛」が動く短い動画を出しました。"], "paragraphs_zh": ["尼康于10月9日宣布，取消显微镜摄影比赛“Small World In Motion”的获奖作品资格。因为该作品使用了生成式AI，违反了比赛规则。尼康解释说：“它不符合规则。”", "获奖者是中国清华大学的宁旭博士。他提交了一段短视频，显示患有呼吸道疾病PCD的儿童气道中，名为“纤毛”的细小毛发状结构在运动。但是，许多科学家和前评委联系尼康，表示“这段视频看起来不真实”。"], "body": "ニコンは10月9日、顕微鏡で撮った写真や動画のコンテスト「スモールワールド・イン・モーション」の受賞作品を失格にしたと発表しました。この作品は生成AIを使って作られていたので、コンテストの規則に違反しているからです。ニコンは「規則に従っていなかった」と説明しました。\n\n受賞したのは中国の清華大学に所属するニン・シュー博士です。彼は、呼吸器の病気PCDを持つ子どもの気道で、毛のような小さな構造「繊毛」が動く短い動画を出しました。", "body_zh": "尼康于10月9日宣布，取消显微镜摄影比赛“Small World In Motion”的获奖作品资格。因为该作品使用了生成式AI，违反了比赛规则。尼康解释说：“它不符合规则。”\n\n获奖者是中国清华大学的宁旭博士。他提交了一段短视频，显示患有呼吸道疾病PCD的儿童气道中，名为“纤毛”的细小毛发状结构在运动。但是，许多科学家和前评委联系尼康，表示“这段视频看起来不真实”。", "text": "ニコンは10月9日、顕微鏡で撮った写真や動画のコンテスト「スモールワールド・イン・モーション」の受賞作品を失格にしたと発表しました。この作品は生成AIを使って作られていたので、コンテストの規則に違反しているからです。ニコンは「規則に従っていなかった」と説明しました。 受賞したのは中国の清華大学に所属するニン・シュー博士です。彼は、呼吸器の病気PCDを持つ子どもの気道で、毛のような小さな構造「繊毛」が動く短い動画を出しました。", "vocab": [{"word": "失格", "pos": "noun", "zh": "取消资格", "note": "表示因违反规则而被取消参赛资格。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "生成AI", "pos": "noun", "zh": "生成式AI", "note": "指能够自动生成图像、文章等的人工智能。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "違反", "pos": "noun", "zh": "违反", "note": "常与“規則”搭配，表示违反规则。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "受賞", "pos": "noun", "zh": "获奖", "note": "表示获得奖项。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "指摘", "pos": "noun", "zh": "指出", "note": "表示指出问题或错误。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "繊毛", "pos": "noun", "zh": "纤毛", "note": "细胞表面细小的毛发状结构。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "気道", "pos": "noun", "zh": "气道", "note": "呼吸时空气通过的管道。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "認める", "pos": "verb", "zh": "承认", "note": "表示承认事实或错误。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "協力", "pos": "noun", "zh": "协助", "note": "表示配合、帮助。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "偽物", "pos": "noun", "zh": "假货", "note": "表示不是真的东西。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "診断", "pos": "noun", "zh": "诊断", "note": "医生判断病情。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "見直す", "pos": "verb", "zh": "重新审视", "note": "表示重新检查并修改。", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Prize-winning image which sparked backlash was AI-generated, Nikon rules", "summary_original": "The camera-maker says it is now re-evaluating the rules and procedures of its Small World in Motion contest.", "body_original": "Prize-winning image which sparked backlash was AI-generated, Nikon rules\nBy\nZoe Kleinman\nTechnology & AI editor\nPublished\n9 October 2026\nThe winner of a prestigious scientific photography competition has been disqualified following concerns raised by other scientists that it was fake.\nNikon said the use of generative AI in the composition of the video broke the rules of its Small World In Motion contest, which accepts photos and video taken using powerful microscopes.\nThe firm said the video \"did not comply with the competition rules regarding generative AI\", but added it was not a judgement of the entrant's professional reputation or scientific contributions.\nIt said it would now look at the rules and procedures of the annual contest, which has been running for 15 years and is specifically for microscopic images.\nNikon said it came to the decision \"after thoroughly re-evaluating the video and supporting materials and consulting with members of our judging panel\".\nThe winning entry came from Dr Ning Xu, from Tsinghua University in China, who submitted a short video showing tiny, hair-like structures called cilia moving in the airway of a child with the respiratory condition PCD.\nThe BBC has approached him for comment.\nA number of scientists, including former competition judges, complained to Nikon on its LinkedIn page that the video did not appear to be real.\nXu had acknowledged using AI, but said he believed he had acted within the rules, and had cooperated with Nikon's investigation.\nUniversity of Leicester scientist Dr Robert Hirst, who was among the first experts to voice concerns, said he was \"not surprised\" and he \"knew immediately that the video was fabricated\".\n\"I have been diagnosing PCD for 20 years by examining their cilia waveform, length, cell size and shape,\" he said.\nHirst, who is lead scientist for the NHS centre for PCD diagnosis at the university, said the cells and cilia \"look nothing like those from PCD patients\".\n\"This controversy has impacted a lot of patients, scientists, doctors and PCD support networks around the world,\" he said.\nTiny image sparks big backlash in Nikon photo contest\nPublished\n1 October\nWhat is AI, how does it work and why are some people concerned about it?\nPublished\n14 September\nSign up for our Tech Decoded newsletter\nto follow the world's top tech stories and trends.\nOutside the UK? Sign up here\n.\nRelated topics\nArtificial intelligence\nPhotography\nScience & Environment", "fetched_at": "2026-10-12T00:40:13.616651", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "ニコン", "s": 0.125, "e": 0.525, "sm": 125, "em": 525, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "は", "s": 0.537, "e": 0.675, "sm": 537, "em": 675, "cs": 3, "ce": 4, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "10", "s": 0.688, "e": 1.021, "sm": 687, "em": 1020, "cs": 4, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "月", "s": 1.021, "e": 1.188, "sm": 1020, "em": 1187, "cs": 6, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "9", "s": 1.2, "e": 1.506, "sm": 1200, "em": 1506, "cs": 7, "ce": 8, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "日", "s": 1.506, "e": 1.812, "sm": 1506, "em": 1812, "cs": 8, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "、", "s": 1.812, "e": 2.138, "sm": 1812, "em": 2137, "cs": 9, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "顕微鏡", "s": 2.138, "e": 2.763, "sm": 2137, "em": 2762, "cs": 10, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "で", "s": 2.775, "e": 2.875, "sm": 2775, "em": 2875, "cs": 13, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "撮っ", "s": 2.888, "e": 3.113, "sm": 2887, "em": 3112, "cs": 14, "ce": 16, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "た", "s": 3.125, "e": 3.225, "sm